------------------------------------------------------------------------
PART I: PERMISSIVE ENGINE TIER (Apache License, Version 2.0)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Applies exclusively to:
- `crates/anvil-dom` (HTML parser & bounded DOM tree)
- `crates/anvil-style` (CSS parser & specificity cascade)
- `crates/anvil-layout` (Block, Inline, Flexbox, & Table layout engine)
- `crates/anvil-paint` (Display list generation & viewport scaling)
- `crates/anvil-raster` (RGBA framebuffer & C++20 SIMD/SDF raster kernel)
- `crates/anvil-script` (script interpreter)

